<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>AI &amp; Agent 开发者晨报</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>每日 AI 领域精选新闻与深度分析</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 06:44:02 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/web/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><item><title>沸#OpenAI公布十项数学理论突破#</title><link>https://openai.com/index/ten-advances-in-mathematics</link><description>OpenAI分享在数学和理论计算机科学方面的十项新成果，包括解决长期未解问题，展示AI在理论领域的潜力。网友A：OpenAI这是要转行搞数学？网友B：AI在数学领域越来越强了。</description><guid>https://openai.com/index/ten-advances-in-mathematics</guid><source>OpenAI</source><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 08:00:00 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>数学</category><category>OpenAI</category></item><item><title>热#Word文档蠕虫劫持Microsoft Copilot#</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/a-security-researcher-built-a-self-spreading-worm-that-hides-inside-word-docs-and-hijacks-microsoft-copilot/</link><description>安全研究员演示一种自我传播的蠕虫，隐藏在Word文档中，可劫持Microsoft Copilot，引发AI安全担忧。网友A：Copilot也不安全了。网友B：Word文档成病毒载体。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/a-security-researcher-built-a-self-spreading-worm-that-hides-inside-word-docs-and-hijacks-microsoft-copilot/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 21:51:57 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>安全</category><category>Microsoft Copilot</category></item><item><title>热#AI破解数学难题引数学界热议#</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/ai-keeps-cracking-unsolved-math-problems-and-mathematicians-have-mixed-feelings/</link><description>OpenAI反驳单位距离猜想，AI辅助数学研究浪潮兴起。数学家们态度复杂，既兴奋AI能力又担忧自身价值。网友A：数学界要变天了？网友B：AI这是要抢饭碗啊。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/ai-keeps-cracking-unsolved-math-problems-and-mathematicians-have-mixed-feelings/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 00:01:31 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>数学</category></item><item><title>热#xAI请求阻止脱衣应用禁令被驳回#</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/01/judge-denies-xais-request-to-block-minnesota-ban-on-nudify-apps/</link><description>美国法官驳回xAI的请求，维持明尼苏达州对“脱衣”应用的禁令，xAI此前提起诉讼挑战该禁令。网友A：AI脱衣应用确实该管。网友B：xAI这次输了。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/01/judge-denies-xais-request-to-block-minnesota-ban-on-nudify-apps/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 04:26:04 +0800</pubDate><category>行业动态</category><category>监管</category><category>xAI</category></item><item><title>热#微软发布AI时代可视化语言Flint#</title><link>https://microsoft.github.io/flint-chart/</link><description>微软开源Flint，一种面向AI时代的可视化语言，旨在简化数据图表生成，提升AI与数据交互效率。网友A：微软又在搞新语言了。网友B：可视化也要AI化了。</description><guid>https://microsoft.github.io/flint-chart/</guid><source>HackerNews AI</source><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 10:45:09 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>可视化</category><category>微软</category></item><item><title>热#天线宝宝机器人保洁200元/小时#</title><link>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/08/464781.html</link><description>国内公司推出“天线宝宝”造型的具身智能保洁机器人，收费200元/小时，纯人工（智能）服务，引发价格讨论。网友A：这价格比真人还贵？网友B：机器人保洁终于来了。</description><guid>https://www.qbitai.com/2026/08/464781.html</guid><source>量子位</source><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 18:45:46 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>具身智能</category><category>机器人</category></item><item><title>#AI编码代理能写代码但不懂科学#</title><link>https://the-decoder.com/ai-coding-agents-can-modernize-research-software-but-cant-judge-if-the-science-is-right/</link><description>OpenAI与学术伙伴的实地报告显示，编码代理可现代化研究软件，但无法判断科学正确性，仍需人类把关。网友A：代码写得溜，科学判断还得靠人。网友B：AI：我只会写代码。</description><guid>https://the-decoder.com/ai-coding-agents-can-modernize-research-software-but-cant-judge-if-the-science-is-right/</guid><source>The Decoder</source><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 22:26:28 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>编码代理</category></item><item><title>#MIT研究：AI理财建议出奇靠谱#</title><link>https://mitsloan.mit.edu/ideas-made-to-matter/ai-financial-advice-surprisingly-good-especially-if-you-ask-right-questions</link><description>MIT Sloan研究发现，AI提供的财务建议效果惊人，尤其当用户提出正确问题时，表现优于许多人类顾问。网友A：以后理财不用找人了？网友B：AI：我比你的理财经理还专业。</description><guid>https://mitsloan.mit.edu/ideas-made-to-matter/ai-financial-advice-surprisingly-good-especially-if-you-ask-right-questions</guid><source>HackerNews AI</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 06:25:12 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>财务</category></item><item><title>#监督式AI代理比自主模型回报更快#</title><link>https://dev.to/khadija_asim_gaper/supervised-ai-agents-pay-off-faster-than-autonomous-models-3d8d</link><description>研究显示，在自动化管理任务中，监督式AI代理比完全自主模型更快产生回报，强调人类监督的重要性。网友A：看来还是得有人看着。网友B：AI再强也离不开人类监督。</description><guid>https://dev.to/khadija_asim_gaper/supervised-ai-agents-pay-off-faster-than-autonomous-models-3d8d</guid><source>DEV.to AI</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 06:40:32 +0800</pubDate><category>论文与研究</category><category>AI代理</category></item><item><title>#AI代理重塑生产软件工作流#</title><link>https://dev.to/khadija_asim_gaper/how-ai-agents-are-reshaping-production-software-workflows-572d</link><description>文章探讨AI代理如何从被动代码生成转向主动重塑生产软件工作流，改变开发方式。网友A：开发方式要变了。网友B：AI代理越来越能干。</description><guid>https://dev.to/khadija_asim_gaper/how-ai-agents-are-reshaping-production-software-workflows-572d</guid><source>DEV.to AI</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 06:37:33 +0800</pubDate><category>Agent框架</category><category>工作流</category></item><item><title>#ChatGPT接入Slack惹内部不满#</title><link>https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/1/greg-brockman/#atom-everything</link><description>Greg Brockman透露OpenAI内部很多人将ChatGPT接入Slack，但同事们并不喜欢这种做法，认为干扰工作。网友A：内部都不爱用，外部吹上天？网友B：这波操作有点迷。</description><guid>https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/1/greg-brockman/#atom-everything</guid><source>Simon Willison</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 06:29:44 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>Slack集成</category></item><item><title>#Billboard热歌被疑AI生成#</title><link>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/974209/fenix-flexin-billboard-hot-100-rubberz-ai-slop</link><description>Fenix Flexin的歌曲《Rubberz》登上Billboard Hot 100，封面艺术几乎确定是AI生成，引发AI音乐是否算“垃圾”的讨论。网友A：AI都能上热榜了？网友B：好听就行。</description><guid>https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/974209/fenix-flexin-billboard-hot-100-rubberz-ai-slop</guid><source>The Verge AI</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 02:20:00 +0800</pubDate><category>AI音乐</category></item><item><title>#NudgeForMe：AI邮件跟进助手#</title><link>https://www.producthunt.com/products/nudgeforme</link><description>Product Hunt上线NudgeForMe，一个AI跟进代理，帮助用户自动识别并跟进错过的邮件商机。网友A：打工人福音。网友B：邮件太多，AI来救。</description><guid>https://www.producthunt.com/products/nudgeforme</guid><source>Product Hunt</source><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 18:42:14 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>邮件</category></item><item><title>#AgentMicro：菜单栏监控AI任务#</title><link>https://www.producthunt.com/products/agentmicro</link><description>AgentMicro在Product Hunt上线，可在macOS菜单栏实时显示Codex任务状态，方便开发者跟踪AI工作。网友A：开发者利器。网友B：摸鱼监控？</description><guid>https://www.producthunt.com/products/agentmicro</guid><source>Product Hunt</source><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 16:27:23 +0800</pubDate><category>产品与发布</category><category>开发工具</category></item><item><title>#Hank Green自曝AI使用不健康#</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/01/youtuber-hank-green-says-his-ai-usage-is-not-healthy/</link><description>知名YouTuber Hank Green公开道歉，称自己对AI的使用导致多巴胺水平异常，承认“不健康”，引发对AI成瘾的讨论。网友A：连网红都戒不掉AI。网友B：AI成瘾是真实问题。</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/01/youtuber-hank-green-says-his-ai-usage-is-not-healthy/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 03:45:45 +0800</pubDate><category>AI成瘾</category></item><item><title>#Sam Altman力推ChatGPT育儿#</title><link>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/01/sam-altman-is-still-making-the-case-for-parenting-via-chatgpt/</link><description>Sam Altman分享用ChatGPT辅助育儿的“酷用例”，继续倡导AI在家庭中的应用，引发争议。网友A：Altman这是要当AI育儿之父？网友B：AI带娃靠谱吗？</description><guid>https://techcrunch.com/2026/08/01/sam-altman-is-still-making-the-case-for-parenting-via-chatgpt/</guid><source>TechCrunch AI</source><pubDate>Sun, 02 Aug 2026 01:07:34 +0800</pubDate><category>ChatGPT</category><category>育儿</category></item><item><title>今日深度分析 - 2026-08-02</title><link>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing</link><description>今日AI圈最重磅当属OpenAI十项数学突破，实打实的硬核成果；而ChatGPT接入Slack惹内部不满这条略显鸡肋，内部吐槽也算新闻？另外Copilot蠕虫和xAI禁令也值得关注。整体看，AI在数学和安全领域动静不小。</description><guid>https://yingfengke.github.io/agent-news-briefing/daily-analysis/20260802</guid></item></channel></rss>